---
title: Slow Cooker Chili
servings: 6
time: 8 hours
tags: beef, chili, slow-cooker, dinner
cuisine: American
course: main
source: chilli_con_carn.png
---

In a #skillet{} over medium heat, brown @ground round{1 1/2%lbs} with @onion{1%large}(chopped) until meat is cooked through (~beef{8%minutes}). Drain excess grease.

Transfer the browned beef and onions into a #slow cooker{}.

Add @chili seasoning mix{1%pkg}, @chili beans with gravy{3%cans}(16 oz each), @diced tomatoes{1%can}(16 oz), and drained @red kidney beans{1%can}(16 oz).

Stir well to blend all ingredients.

Cover and cook on Low for ~{8%hours} (or on High for ~{4%hours}).
